WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,710 --> 00:00:08,070
We have all kinds of coffee, which one do you want?

2
00:00:08,510 --> 00:00:10,930
Who drinks these?

3
00:00:11,490 --> 00:00:12,530
We want super coffee

4
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:20,050
Super coffee xu laosan

5
00:00:20,290 --> 00:00:24,020
Aren't you buying coffee? Why are you standing here buying shit?

6
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:25,460
Boss Lin has run away

7
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:26,940
No more super coffee from now on

8
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:29,420
You two are useless

9
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:31,510
Boss Lin has moved away

10
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:32,910
But I moved to the opposite side

11
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:35,740
It's really on the opposite side

12
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:39,060
Then why haven't you opened the door yet?

13
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,940
There’s no need to go through the formalities when moving a store. The earliest you can do it is tomorrow.
